  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Anti-Fraud and Corruption Training and Data-Analytics Training</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This training is a follow-up of the Anti-Fraude and Corruption training in 2022. The Contr&#xf4;le G&#xe9;n&#xe9;ral des Finances (CGF) has shown interest in providing this training for other employees of CGF.&#x2022;	Training 1: Organise a second similar training for the rest of the CGF government officials (about 25 participants) on anti-fraud and corruption.During the Shiraka Training Programme in Tunis in May 2022 Dutch National Academy for Finance and Economies (NAFE) and CGF also discussed a second topic: how to make better use of the data CGF has access to.Therefore, a complementary training has been developed to make better use of their data capabilities based on the recent developments and experiences of reforms at the Central Government Audit Service (CGAS):&#x2022;	Training 2: Organise a training for CGF on data analytics and data usage within the Internal Audit function, based on experiences and best practices from CGAS, for about 25 participants.</narrative>
  </description>
